  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:00am"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "消灭侦查部队后，不会剩多少时间。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "正如你所说。时间紧迫。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "干员不会站在沙地上扒城上去。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "呃......有些时候我们是会这么做啦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "但是核心城正在移动中，要想进入下层基础结构，确实不容易。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "如果干员站在沙地上等着移动城邦驶过，无论是相对速度还是相对高度，都限制了干员的行动。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "没办法打开移动城邦底部的维修窗口与废料出口的话，准备好的诱饵与隐蔽会失去意义。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "所以，我们的五支小队会通过载具，以沙尘作为掩护接近核心城，最后利用工具登上核心城的底层工业结构。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "罗德岛居然只派遣了五支小队？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我们没有急着想让乌萨斯的地方将领捏到我们把柄的意思。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "更不希望他们派出一艘高速军舰，在荒原上摧毁我们的船舰，杀死我们的雇员。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "即使事情这么发生了，你也不会在任何一张报纸上看见证据。银行家和保险业只会划去你的名字，将所有的积累全部放进自己的保险库。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "没有人会开口，因为乌萨斯不会希望有人开口。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "中立身份意味着我们在夹缝中依然拥有些许的自由，相应的，罗德岛不能拥有任何政治势力作为后盾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "隐蔽行事是我们的生存理念。派遣小队去救你时，也是一样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "五支小队。留下痕迹、清除痕迹；目标完成、目标失败。无论如何，罗德岛最多只能派出五支小队。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但更多小队意味着更多的武装力量！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "即使没办法解决问题？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "即使是龙门这样的城邦，想要消灭我们也是易如反掌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你也看见了，成建制的近卫局和比起各国顶级精英武装也毫不逊色的特殊部队，他们的实力远不是一家医药公司能比的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那为什么我们要参与？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "因为这个阴谋已经卷入了感染者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "现在，罗德岛已经离开了龙门，以每小时十五公里的速度驶向下一个贸易城邦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "在这之前，我们可能会在荒野上停留数个星期。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "除了靠近我们的罗德岛通讯专员和可信任船只，没有人会收到我们的信号，我们会在各城邦的移动规划中，挑选出避开所有人的路线。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "即使龙门在事件过后反悔，他们也没法再找到我们。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但这样还不够吧？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这一拳打上去不够狠！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "还要更锋利。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们的赌注应该不会只有这点。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "没错。我们还需要额外的致命砝码。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "博士和凯尔希，都变得很阴沉可怕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "就算我知道事情的必要性，你们也不用......露出那种笑容吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "阿米娅......我笑了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我知道凯尔希医生笑了啦。虽然你嘴唇不动，但我是能感受到笑的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "竟然是这样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......真好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "不，事先声明，我没有要和这个人修缮人际关系的意思。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "呵，我也没这个意思。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "有无必要取决于双方的自由意愿。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "欸......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "这五支小队，将分别由我、阿米娅与另外三位精英干员带领。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "三支作战小队，一支侦察小队，以及一支特殊作业小队。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "其中，有一支作战小队的队长，你也许该先见她一面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "迷迭香！等等！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊......煌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你伤得好重，怎么还跑出来？快回去。快点回去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "你这次要出战？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "我找人替你。让Misery去。他比你擅长攻坚战。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "他一挥手就能解决的事，让他去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你不想我去？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "对，你不该去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "煌让人感觉很奇怪。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "这和你以前的任务可不一样！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "因为可能会死？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "说啥啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "你怎么能，怎么......是怎么这么轻松地说出来啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "你年纪太小了，这么危险的任务，你是不该去的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可阿米娅也要去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "因为她......！她是......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "她是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "阿米娅......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她和我一样，是感染者，也是干员。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而且，我检查了日志。Ace和Scout都在切尔诺伯格，他们没回来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "也就是说，他们已经不在了吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我想去看看。我要明白是怎么回事。我要看看管整合运动的人，我要知道是谁做了什么。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我要知道在Ace和Scout身上发生了什么。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#10",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "迷迭香？这种事你......你可以不记的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......煌？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "(粗口)，我他妈在说什么......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "不，对不起，我不该这么说。我不应该。**，我这张臭嘴！"
        },
