        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "错的是我。开心是记忆，伤心也是记忆。我的错。你不能不记。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "煌变得很奇怪。说的话也支离破碎的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "......我不想你那么痛苦。为什么非要去回头看它？如果是你的话......是可以把记忆放走的啊。"
        },
