        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "罗德岛雇佣的精英干员们，都因为种种原因，将自身的精力和专业才能奉献给了罗德岛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "他们带领的小队会全心全意地支持他们的工作，因为精英干员在某些程度上，可以直接决定一种战术的运用方式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "但他们并不都......符合我们的想象。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "精英干员煌，博士你是见过的。有关煌的很多传闻，可能博士都没听过，实际上，被干员们添油加醋得有些厉害。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "但现在这一位精英干员，所有人对她的印象都不一样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "如果是博士，应该是能......慢慢地理解她和她的选择的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "看你的反应，也许你已经见过了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "啊？呜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "那......那这样就可以了吗？"
        }
      ]
