          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "但......阳光好清澈啊，为什么阳光能穿透沙尘？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "核心城底部的可见度似乎增加了，简直是......法术。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我们没有......没有这个安排吧？是自然光吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "临光",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "......先别管这么多了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "明白！牵引装置，准备发射！各干员，优先确定滑索是否已经完全固定在核心城底部的墙面上！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "所有干员都完成转移后，载具会立刻驶走！尽管我很少这么说，但各位干员，我想，现在的阳光，是我们会走好运的兆头！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "临光",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "......一定是！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "临光",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "（一不小心让光芒变得太强烈了，只能往地面倾泻这种事我怎么说得出口......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "临光",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "等等，核心城似乎在加速？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "临光",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "即使整个装置借助了风势，也只能保证沙尘的泼洒涵盖到一公里以内的范围！一旦驶出范围，他们必定会发现我们！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "各位，动作快！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "驾驶员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "来不及了！我们必须立刻减速！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "驾驶员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一旦驶出扬尘的范围，切尔诺伯格核心城的光学观察装置可能会立刻捕捉到我们，潜入行动会因此失败！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "驾驶员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "无论你们还剩几个队员，都快......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "已经不剩下队员了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "驾驶员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "欸？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我自己来！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（默默戴上防尘面具）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "请将搭扣给我，我一个人上去。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "驾驶员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......太危险了，博士！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "驾驶员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "没有经过干员训练的人独自登城，简直离谱！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "驾驶员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "凯尔希医生居然没有给你安排战场辅助人员吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没有就没有，还能怎么样呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "也许想锻炼我的身体素质才刻意没安排。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "有。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "凯尔希一只手环抱过你的腰部，将你拉上了滑索。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，下次再自己把握命运吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "风沙很大，那只“手”很坚硬，你有点不确定它是否属于凯尔希。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "各个小队，请各就各位！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "接下来的行动，我们不能有任何失误！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "10:30 a.m.\n核心城地下基建"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "没错，这个痕迹确实也是侵入的痕迹。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可以确定入侵者只有一人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "前面的血迹，分不清是整合运动的还是谁的，血液还没完全变性。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "很可能就是陈警官......！我们必须加快速度。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "啊，博士！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "你安全抵达就好。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那也能叫安全......！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......很险。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "托某人的福，我可能差点就见不着你了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......嗯？啊？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "很，很危险吗？Dr.{@nickname}，有没有受伤？！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没事，走吧。只是心理创伤而已。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    }
